{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "e-although-though",
  "lexicon": "zkv",
  "number": 53,
  "kind": "word",
  "headword": "although / though",
  "ipa": [
    "ɔːlˈðəʊ",
    "ðəʊ"
  ],
  "star": true,
  "levelMark": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "conj.",
      "zh": "虽然，尽管"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Although"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " she is over 85 years old, she still looks after herself very well."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "她虽然年过 85 岁，（但）仍然能很好地照顾自己。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "although/though 是常考单词，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要掌握其用法："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) 句中用了 although/though，不能再用 but。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2) although/though 可以和 but 进行句型转换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如："
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Although/Though"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " he was English, he could speak Japanese fluently."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= He was English, "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "but"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " he could speak Japanese fluently."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "他虽然是英国人，但能说一口流利的日语。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Although/Though"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " we can’t smell the air, it is around us."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= We can’t smell the air, "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "but"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " air is around us."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "虽然我们闻不到空气，但空气就在我们周围。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
